<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Pojistovna posts CZK 121.875mln net.</title>
<headline>Czech Pojistovna posts CZK 121.875mln net.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The largest Czech insurer Ceska Pojistovna a.s. said on Thursday it posted first half 1997 net profits of 121.875 million crowns versus 168.339 million in the same period last year.  </p>
<p>NOTE: The results were compiled according to Czech accounting standards.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
